cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果本项目对你的工作有帮助，请按以下格式引用。"
title: "深空堆栈工具（Deep-Sky Stacker）"
abstract: "面向深空摄影的批量堆栈工具：暗场/平场校正、星点配准、单遍 κσ 叠加、去光污染、小波降噪、星点分离与星场盲解目标识别，支持 CPU/GPU 与图形界面。"
authors:
  - family-names: "MRZH"
    given-names: ""
    alias: "MRZH"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MRZH-shion/deep-sky-stacker"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - astrophotography
  - image-stacking
  - plate-solving
  - deep-sky
references:
